# CONTROL

## Interrupt and steer
- Cmd+Return sends now, or the next queued item
- Interrupt, recover, then follow up with a user turn
- Alternative: inject after tool results

## /goal [string|file]
- Stop hook blocks until complete
- Covers /loop [time], /wait <N>, /watch todo.md
- Stop guard variant: same cached prefix plus a review checklist
